    /// Returns the index of the first occurrence of `key` in `a`,
    /// or `a.len()` if `key` does not occur.
    ///
    /// Requirements:
    ///   - a.len() > 0
    ///
    /// Ensures:
    ///   - 0 <= index <= a.len()
    ///   - If index < a.len(), then
